"hautatuko dira leiho nagusian."

#. TRANSLATORS: the * and ? characters are the ASCII wildcard special symbols,
#. and they must not be localized.
#: thunar/thunar-standard-view.c:2776
msgctxt "Select by Pattern dialog: tooltips: pattern entry text box"
msgid ""
"? matches exactly one character,\n"
"* matches any number of characters, including zero.\n"
"\n"
"For example: *.txt, file??.png, pict\n"
"\n"
"Without any * or ? wildcards, the pattern will match anywhere in a name. With wildcards, the pattern must match at both the start and the end of a name."
msgstr ""
"? karaktere bakar batekin bat dator,\n"
"* edozein karaktere kopururekin bat dator, zero barne.\n"
"\n"
"Adibidez: *.txt, fitx??.png, argaz\n"
"\n"
"* edo ? komodinik gabe, ereduak izenaren edozein lekutan egin dezake bat. Komodinekin, ereduak izenaren hasieran eta amaieran egin behar du bat."

#: thunar/thunar-standard-view.c:2780
msgctxt "Select by Pattern dialog: labels: case sensitive checkbox"
msgid "C_ase sensitive"
msgstr "Bereizi _maiuskulak/minuskulak"

#: thunar/thunar-standard-view.c:2781
msgctxt "Select by Pattern dialog: tooltips: case sensitive checkbox"
msgid ""
"If enabled, letter case must match the pattern.\n"
"Examp* would match Example.txt and not example.txt"
msgstr ""
"Gaituta badago, maiuskulek eta minuskulek ereduarekin bat etorri behar dute.\n"
"Adib* bat letorke Adibidea.txt-rekin, baina ez adibidea.txt-rekin"

#: thunar/thunar-standard-view.c:2786
msgctxt "Select by Pattern dialog: labels: match diacritics checkbox"
msgid "_Match diacritics"
msgstr "Bereizi _diakritikoak"

#: thunar/thunar-standard-view.c:2787
msgctxt "Select by Pattern dialog: tooltips: match diacritics checkbox"
msgid ""
"If enabled, require accents to match the pattern.\n"
"Rés* would match Résumé.txt and not Resume.txt"
msgstr ""
"Gaituta badago, azentuek ereduarekin bat etorri behar dute.\n"
"Rés* bat letorke Résumé.txt-rekin, baina ez Resume.txt-rekin"

